  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Strengthen Regional Governments for the Management of Infrastructure and Urban Services at the Metropolitan Scale</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Fortalecimiento de Gobiernos Regionales en la Gestin de Infraestructura y Servicios Urbanos a Escala Metropolitana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de la operacin es fortalecer a los Gobiernos Regionales (GORE) para generar infraestructura que provea servicios urbanos a escala metropolitana. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) fortalecer la capacidad institucional de los GORE, para ejercer sus competencias a escala metropolitana con un enfoque en cambio climtico, y gnero y diversidad; (ii) fortalecer las capacidades tcnicas de los GORE a travs de la gestin y ejecucin de proyectos de servicios de infraestructura de escala metropolitana, priorizando inversiones que consideren la mejora de la resiliencia y reduccin de emisiones de Gases de Efecto Invernadero, y que consideren aspectos de gnero y diversidad</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the operation is to strengthen the Regional Governments (GORE) to generate infrastructure that provides urban services on a metropolitan scale. The specific objectives are: (i) strengthen the institutional capacity of the GORE, to exercise their powers at a metropolitan scale with a focus on change climate, and gender and diversity; (ii) strengthen the technical capacities of the GORE through the management and execution of metropolitan-scale infrastructure service projects, prioritizing investments that consider the improvement of resilience and reduction of Greenhouse Gas emissions, and that consider gender and diversity aspects.</narrative>
  </description>
